```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> UPLOADED
    UPLOADED --> ANALYSIS_PENDING
    ANALYSIS_PENDING --> ANALYZING
    ANALYZING --> REVIEW_REQUIRED
    ANALYZING --> ANALYSIS_FAILED
    ANALYSIS_FAILED --> ANALYSIS_PENDING: Reintentar
    REVIEW_REQUIRED --> EDITING
    EDITING --> REVIEW_REQUIRED
    REVIEW_REQUIRED --> APPROVED
    APPROVED --> [*]
```

**Source:** arc42.md §6.4 Estados de análisis y trabajos (analysis state machine)

**Purpose:** Defines the allowed analysis states and transitions. A page starts at UPLOADED, moves to ANALYSIS_PENDING when queued, to ANALYZING while the worker processes, then to REVIEW_REQUIRED when proposals are ready. Failed analysis can be retried back to ANALYSIS_PENDING. The user edits in EDITING, returns to REVIEW_REQUIRED, or approves to reach APPROVED, which is the terminal state permitting colorization.
